From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 09:59:19 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Read a ledger cell's cards from its stored layout

A ledger cell's releases were grouped into pressing rows and cards again
every time a verdict or run was read. The ledger statement now selects each
answered cell's cards, and the count of its pressing rows, from the layout
the ledger's write stored.

